WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.053 --> 00:00:14.139
It is a mutual understanding

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:19.394
of what the material gives us
and how we can build it.

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:24.733
I mean, we don't pronounce the words, but
we feel them while building up the story

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:26.860
and while building up the scenes.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.571
Every eye flick, every head shake,

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:31.197
they all convey emotion.

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:35.827
Baz came up with an expression
which he used called poetic glue.

00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:41.374
It’s basically shorthand for layering extra
information visually on top of the picture.

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:46.337
So we see the collage of different
headlines to add extra information

00:00:46.337 --> 00:00:50.175
to give to the audience without adding time.

00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:55.180
The way that world wide audiences
have responded to Top Gun: Maverick

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:58.516
has been far beyond anything
that the cast and crew dreamed of.

00:00:58.516 --> 00:01:01.770
So thank you for watching and
I'm thrilled you enjoyed the movie.

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:03.897
Working with the actors performances

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:07.025
and finding that balance between light and dark,

00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:08.109
comedy and drama.

00:01:08.109 --> 00:01:12.280
And then finding and shaping the
sequences and the dialogue in the scenes

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:13.948
was such a rewarding experience.

00:01:13.948 --> 00:01:16.117
One of the big challenges we had was just

00:01:16.117 --> 00:01:17.202
kind of reining ourselves in.

00:01:17.202 --> 00:01:18.995
There was so much good material

00:01:18.995 --> 00:01:22.832
and so much good improv on set
and the first cut we just threw it all in.

00:01:22.832 --> 00:01:26.002
That was kind of a struggle over
the next basically eleven months

00:01:26.002 --> 00:01:29.047
was deciding what bits to lose
and what bits to keep

00:01:29.047 --> 00:01:32.342
because they were all great bits,
but they couldn't all coexist together.

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:36.012
The choices that are open to the editor

00:01:36.012 --> 00:01:38.389
in how best to convey the story.

00:01:38.389 --> 00:01:40.183
are limitless.

